@startuml Tseten API Endpoints and Controllers
!define RECTANGLE_WIDTH 280
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam wrapWidth 250
skinparam maxMessageSize 200

title Tseten REST API - Endpoints and Controllers

skinparam component {
    BackgroundColor #E8F5E9
    BorderColor #2E7D32
}

skinparam interface {
    BackgroundColor #FFF3E0
    BorderColor #E65100
}

package "API Controllers" {
    
    component [SoftwareRequirementsController] as srController
    
    component [TagsController] as tagController
    
    component [UserController] as userController
}

interface "IMediator" as mediator
interface "ITsetenContext" as context
interface "IEmbeddingService" as embedding
interface "ITokenService" as tokenService
interface "IPasswordHasher" as passwordHasher

srController --> mediator : sends requests
tagController --> mediator : sends requests
userController --> mediator : sends requests

mediator --> context : data access
mediator --> embedding : vector operations
mediator --> tokenService : JWT generation
mediator --> passwordHasher : password hashing

note right of srController
  **Main Controller**
  Handles all requirement
  CRUD operations plus
  semantic search and
  embedding sync.
  
  Uses MediatR to dispatch
  commands and queries.
end note

note bottom of userController
  **Authentication**
  JWT Bearer token based.
  Password hashing with salt.
  Role-based authorization.
  
  Swagger requires Bearer
  token in Authorization header.
end note

note right of embedding
  **Vector Search**
  Converts text to 384-dim
  embeddings. Cosine similarity
  ranking. SQL Server storage.
end note

@enduml
